          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#FFF8F2; --card:#FFEFE0; --accent:#C76A3B; --muted:#6B5A50; --sage:#8AA59B; --radius:14px; --max:980px;\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n      color:var(--muted);\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#FFF);display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:36px 18px}\\n    .wrap{width:100%;max-width:var(--max)}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .brand .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sage),#D7EDE6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#fff}\\n    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(199,106,59,0.06)}\\n\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:20px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;color:#5A3D2E}\\n    .hero p{margin:0 0 18px 0;line-height:1.5}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .meta a{background:rgba(90,61,46,0.06);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\\n    .hero-visual{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .visual-img{width:100%;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#FFF5ED;padding:18px}\\n    .contact-form{margin-top:12px}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(90,61,46,0.08);font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px}\\n    .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\\n    .section{margin:18px 0}\\n    .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n\\n    .proves{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .small-card{background:#FFF;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(139,115,103,0.06)}\\n    .benefits-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:12px}\\n\\n    .process-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .step{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFF,#FFF8F2);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border-left:6px solid var(--sage)}\\n\\n    .faq-item{margin-bottom:10px}\\n    .lead-magnet{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FFF9F4,#FFF)}\\n    .cta-bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FFEDE3,#FFF);margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin-top:22px;color:rgba(90,61,46,0.6);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .visual-img{width:100%}\\n      .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">W</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#5A3D2E\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <!-- HERO -->\\n      <section class=\\\"hero card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-hero-title\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h1 id=\\\"contact-hero-title\\\">Let's design a calmer, steadier rhythm for your days</h1>\\n          <p>I'm {{COACH_NAME}} ({{CREDENTIALS}}). I help busy people build daily habits and simple rituals that create long-term energy, clarity, and resilience — without extreme schedules or one-size-fits-all programs.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Email: {{EMAIL}}</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <aside class=\\\"hero-visual\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"visual-img\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"assets/img/hero.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Organic illustrated circle with leaves\\\" style=\\\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small-card\\\">\\n            <strong style=\\\"display:block\\\">VIP Day Available</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">A focused, single-day intensive to surface your core habits and create a 90-day plan.</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve a VIP Day</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- SOCIAL PROOF -->\\n      <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"social-title\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"social-title\\\">Kind words and real results</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"proves\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"small-card\\\" style=\\\"min-width:220px\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"Coach avatar\\\" style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;float:left;margin-right:10px\\\" />\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">\\\"Gentle, precise, and practical.\\\"</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">— A client in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small-card\\\" style=\\\"min-width:220px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">\\\"I sleep better and finally stick to a morning rhythm.\\\"</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">— Working parent</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small-card\\\" style=\\\"min-width:220px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">\\\"Clear steps and no fluff — exactly what I needed.\\\"</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">— Entrepreneur</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- BENEFITS -->\\n      <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"benefits-title\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"benefits-title\\\">What people gain working with me</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"benefits-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"small-card\\\"><strong>Daily clarity</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Simple prompts to start each morning with purpose.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small-card\\\"><strong>Predictable energy</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Habits that maintain energy without caffeine cycles.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small-card\\\"><strong>Manageable routines</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Frameworks that fit your life, not replace it.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"small-card\\\"><strong>Accountability that feels supportive</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Holding you to simple, consistent shifts.</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- PROCESS -->\\n      <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"process-title\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"process-title\\\">How we work together</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"process-steps\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>1. Discovery Session</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">A 45-minute conversation to map current habits and priorities.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>2. Tailored Framework</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">A personalized routine built around your life windows and energy patterns.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>3. Implementation Support (VIP Day option)</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Focused implementation in a single intensive or ongoing weekly check-ins.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>4. Adjust & Sustain</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Short cycles of refinement so the practices stick for months, not days.</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- FAQ -->\\n      <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-title\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"faq-title\\\">Questions people often ask</h2>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><strong>Do you use a one-size-fits-all plan?</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">No. Every plan I create is tailored to your rhythms and constraints — the goal is reliability, not perfection.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><strong>How long before I feel a difference?</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Most clients notice small shifts in 2–3 weeks; meaningful habit change builds across 6–12 weeks.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><strong>Can I do a one-day intensive only?</strong>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Yes — the VIP Day is designed for focused, actionable change and pairs well with follow-ups.</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- LEAD MAGNET -->\\n      <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"lead-title\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"lead-title\\\">Complementary resource: The Daily Reset Checklist</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"lead-magnet\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">A short, practical checklist to close your day and wake refreshed.</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Enter your email and I'll send the PDF — simple, printable, and immediately useful.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <form id=\\\"lead-form\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return handleLead(event)\\\" style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <input name=\\\"lead_email\\\" id=\\\"lead_email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"your@email.com\\\" required style=\\\"min-width:220px\\\" />\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send the checklist</button>\\n          </form>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- CONTACT FORM + CTA -->\\n      <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"reach-title\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"reach-title\\\">Ready to begin? Reach out.</h2>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Tell me a little about what you're hoping to change and your availability for a discovery chat.</p>\\n        <form class=\\\"contact-form\\\" id=\\\"contact\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return submitContact(event)\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"grid-2\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" required />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"two-col\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"when\\\">Preferred timing</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"when\\\" name=\\\"when\\\">\\n                <option value=\\\"next_week\\\">Next week</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"next_month\\\">Next month</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"no_rush\\\">No rush</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\">A brief note about your goals</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"What would you like to focus on?\\\" required></textarea>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Request a free discovery</button>\\n            <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\" style=\\\"background:var(--sage);color:#fff\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"cta-bar\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Prefer to speak or book directly?</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Call {{PHONE}} or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n            <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Schedule a VIP Day</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Guided by {{COACH_NAME}} • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    function handleLead(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var email = document.getElementById('lead_email').value;\\n      if(!email) return false;\\n      // In a real implementation, submit to server. For now, open the primary CTA with email as query.\\n      var url = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?lead=' + encodeURIComponent(email);\\n      window.location.href = url;\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n\\n    function submitContact(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      var data = {\\n        name: document.getElementById('name').value,\\n        email: document.getElementById('email').value,\\n        phone: document.getElementById('phone').value,\\n        when: document.getElementById('when').value,\\n        message: document.getElementById('message').value\\n      };\\n      // Minimal mailto fallback for static sites\\n      var subject = encodeURIComponent('Discovery request from ' + data.name);\\n      var body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+data.name+'\\\\nEmail: '+data.email+'\\\\nPhone: '+data.phone+'\\\\nWhen: '+data.when+'\\\\n\\\\nMessage:\\\\n'+data.message);\\n      window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# wellness_coach-2026-02-16T04-28-36-799Z-024 — chunk 4\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page and a README describing structure and intent.\\n\\nFiles included in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — A full contact page designed for the \\\"earthy_warm\\\" layout family with the gentle_therapist voice and VIP Day program model.\\n\\nDesign notes (contact.html):\\n- Purpose: primary destination for leads to get in touch, request discovery calls, sign up for the lead magnet, or reserve a VIP Day.\\n- Visual language: warm, organic palette (terracotta accent, sage highlights, soft sand background), rounded cards, generous spacing and approachable type scale.\\n- Required sections present on this page (these also \\\"ripple\\\" to other pages via nav and CTAs):\\n  - hero — Lead with values, contact quick-links, and VIP Day highlight (primary visual references assets/img/hero.svg).\\n  - social_proof — Compact testimonials and avatar image (assets/img/avatar.svg).\\n  - benefits — Outcome-focused list emphasizing habits, routines, and frameworks.\\n  - process — Clear step-by-step approach including VIP Day and ongoing work.\\n  - faq — Frequently asked questions tuned to coaching expectations and timeframe.\\n  - lead_magnet — Email capture for a free \\\"Daily Reset Checklist\\\" with a simple form that redirects to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} when submitted.\\n  - cta — Multiple CTAs: request discovery, book VIP Day, phone and email links using {{PHONE}} and {{EMAIL}}.\\n\\nTechnical notes:\\n- No external assets or CDNs are used. The HTML references local SVGs expected elsewhere in the project: assets/img/hero.svg, assets/img/avatar.svg, assets/img/pattern.svg.\\n- Placeholders used throughout to be replaced at build or runtime:\\n  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}\\n- Form behavior is intentionally minimal:\\n  - Lead magnet form navigates to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} with the email as a query parameter.\\n  - Contact form uses a mailto fallback for static deployments; replace with server endpoint or third-party form handler for production.\\n\\nAccessibility & responsiveness:\\n- Uses semantic headings and labels for form fields.\\n- Layout adapts to narrow screens with stacked columns and larger touch targets.\\n\\nCustomization guidance:\\n- Swap colors in :root to match branding; keep warm contrast for CTA and sage for supportive accents.\\n- Replace simple mailto logic with an AJAX POST to capture leads server-side and hook into email/CRM flows.\\n- Ensure the three SVGs are present at assets/img/hero.svg, assets/img/avatar.svg, and assets/img/pattern.svg and are uniquely crafted for each page template.\\n\\nNavigation phrasing:\\n- Nav labels in this file are intentionally varied (Home, About, Paths, Invest, Stories, Book, Connect) to meet the uniqueness requirement across templates. Ensure other pages maintain slight variations to avoid identical headings/link text.\\n\\nProgram & pricing guidance:\\n- This site uses a VIP Day offering as the highlighted program model; other pages (programs, pricing) should present different program names and pricing framings (e.g., \\\"Foundations\\\", \\\"Quarter Flow\\\", \\\"Sustained Support\\\") to meet uniqueness rules.\\n\\nIf you need the remaining pages or the SVG assets created next, request the next chunk and specify any branding colors, imagery direction, or adjustments to content tone.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
